      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have no idea how this works. It seems like there must be some kind of race condition on `xmit_status`, but I don\u0027t know what it could be.",
      "revId": "05bf31ca8e5cba9fe7fc9151e67372730f31e01f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
